title: Nutanix Prism: VM Status (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the actual status of the VM.
 The desired state of the VM can be configured thrue the coresponding rule.

 If the VM is not in the wanted state, the state of the service depends on
 the power state of the VM. The default mapping (e.g. OFF is WARN, UNDETERMINED
 is UNKNOWN) can be changed per power state with the rule "Nutanix single VM
 State", as well as the state for power states not known to the check.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created.
